### 1. Test Validation (Should Fail - Missing Password)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin"
}

### 2. Valid Login (Assuming setup-admin was run previously)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "securepassword123"
}

// Copy the "token" from the response above and use it below!

